{
    "background_story": "Misael was a skilled citrus farmer in a small village surrounded by lush orange groves. He took great pride in his work, carefully tending to each tree to ensure the juiciest oranges for the local market. However, what set Misael apart was his talent for inventing gadgets to make his work easier. He created a peculiar device that could extract every last drop of juice from an orange, earning him the nickname 'The Squeezer.' News of his remarkable invention spread quickly, and soon people were coming from all over to taste the most refreshing orange juice they had ever had. Misael's 'Squeezer' became a staple in the village, and he was celebrated for his ingenuity and dedication to his craft.",
